---
kind: lore
id: mid.route10
title: Route 10, the Mill Road (Silvercrest to Wardenmere)
---

// Route 10 runs downhill from Silvercrest to Wardenmere past the old mill.
// By day it belongs to cyclists and strollers; after dark the Mill Road Riders
// take it over (the Monster Center board's night patrol, midNightPatrol).

<beat id="arrive" on="enterRoute" target="route.r10" title="The Mill Road" priority="10" once="run">
  ::bg{location="route-10" time="day"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The Mill Road drops out of Silvercrest in one long, straight run, all the way down to the marsh roofs of Wardenmere. Halfway down, the old mill wheel turns for nobody.
  @narrator{code="0020"}: Skid marks on the tarmac, and a sign at the top: CYCLISTS DISMOUNT. Nobody has ever dismounted.
</beat>

<entry id="midR10Morning" on="enterRoute" target="route.r10" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Morning mist from the marsh fills the bottom of the road. Runa is already out, doing laps.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10Day" on="enterRoute" target="route.r10" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Strollers, parasols and a gentleman walking a Hornrake on a lead. The mill wheel creaks along.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10Night" on="enterRoute" target="route.r10" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Headlights at the top of the hill. Engines. The Mill Road Riders own this road after dark, and they want you to know it.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10Sign" on="talk" target="npc.r10Signpost" category="bark">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: ROUTE 10 — THE MILL ROAD. Wardenmere below. Steep hill: check your brakes. Check your monsters' brakes.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10WatchmanNight" on="talk" target="npc.r10Watchman" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @r10Watchman{code="0010"}: The Riders again. Every night, up and down, up and down. The Center in Silvercrest has a notice up: a bounty for anybody who beats all three.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10WatchmanQuiet" on="talk" target="npc.r10Watchman" category="bark" priority="20" when="holds('defeated', ['r10BikerGrit']) && holds('defeated', ['r10BikerVanya']) && holds('defeated', ['r10RockerJolene'])">
  @r10Watchman{code="0010"}: Quiet nights now. I've started reading. Did you know the mill used to grind apples? Nobody knows why.
</entry>

<entry id="midR10WatchmanDay" on="talk" target="npc.r10Watchman" category="bark">
  @r10Watchman{code="0010"}: Day shift is easy. The trouble on this road starts after dark. Come back at night if you're the brave sort.
</entry>

// ── day trainers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10GentlemanAubrey" when="!@isNight" who="r10GentlemanAubrey" intro="A battle before luncheon? How very sporting of you." win="Splendid! Utterly splendid. I've lost my appetite, in the best way." lose="Well played, young one, though not well enough." prize="1200" instance="use-001"/>

<entry id="midR10GentlemanAubreyAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10GentlemanAubrey" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10GentlemanAubrey']) && !@isNight">
  @r10GentlemanAubrey{code="0010"}: I used to play the slots at the Game Corner. Then they hired those fellows in black caps. The machines have been so very unlucky since.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10BeautyCelestine" when="!@isNight" who="r10BeautyCelestine" intro="Don't look at my monsters like that. Look at them like THIS: in awe." win="Awe. Yes. That's the look I meant, just on me." lose="Stunning, as usual." prize="880" instance="use-002"/>

<entry id="midR10BeautyCelestineAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10BeautyCelestine" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10BeautyCelestine']) && !@isNight">
  @r10BeautyCelestine{code="0010"}: I walk down this hill every day for my complexion. The marsh air, you know. Also I live at the bottom.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10CyclistRuna" when="!@isNight" who="r10CyclistRuna" intro="Forty laps before breakfast! You're lap forty-one!" win="Lap forty-one: lost. Lap forty-two: lunch." lose="Personal best! Don't tell my coach it was against you." prize="560" instance="use-003"/>

<entry id="midR10CyclistRunaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10CyclistRuna" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10CyclistRuna']) && !@isNight">
  @r10CyclistRuna{code="0010"}: I'm out of here by sunset. The Riders don't like sharing the hill, and they don't use lights.
</entry>

// ── night trainers: the Mill Road Riders (midNightPatrol) ─────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10BikerGrit" when="@isNight" who="r10BikerGrit" intro="This is Riders' road after dark. You want through, you ride through me." win="Aw, man. My bike's fine. My pride's got a flat." lose="Go home, kid. Take the long way." prize="960" instance="use-004"/>

<entry id="midR10BikerGritAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10BikerGrit" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10BikerGrit']) && @isNight">
  @r10BikerGrit{code="0010"}: We're not a gang. We're a club. A club with jackets. And a secret handshake nobody remembers.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10BikerVanya" when="@isNight" who="r10BikerVanya" intro="Smell that? Smogball exhaust. Best smell on the road." win="Cough. That's not the exhaust, that's losing." lose="Breathe it in, kid!" prize="960" instance="use-005"/>

<entry id="midR10BikerVanyaAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10BikerVanya" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10BikerVanya']) && @isNight">
  @r10BikerVanya{code="0010"}: Kessler used to ride with us. Before he got all serious about poison and gyms. He still has the jacket. He just doesn't wear it where you can see.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r10RockerJolene" when="@isNight" who="r10RockerJolene" intro="I lead the Riders! Well, I lead the singing. Same thing, louder!" win="Encore? No? Nobody? Fine." lose="Thank you, Mill Road! Goodnight!" prize="1040" instance="use-006"/>

<entry id="midR10RockerJoleneAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r10RockerJolene" category="bark" when="holds('defeated', ['r10RockerJolene']) && @isNight">
  @r10RockerJolene{code="0010"}: You beat the whole club. That makes you an honorary Rider. There's no jacket. We ran out of jackets.
</entry>
